    solutions: ["Drove deep precast reinforced concrete sheet piles and heavy stone-filled wire gabions to permanently armor the riverbank against scouring.", "Utilized trenchless micro-tunneling to install interceptor sewer pipes deep beneath historical waterfront lanes."],
